  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>Robot_Safety_Note</name>
    <x>45</x>
    <y>700</y>
    <width>920</width>
    <height>70</height>
    <text>Select Disabled, EPICS or Joystick ownership explicitly. STOP ALL disables both modes and preserves holding current. Joystick motion requires neutral with deadman released after mode changes or reconnects. Limits remain enforced by the shim. EPICS jog requires both axes idle, fresh and motor-enabled. Check Fault for rejected commands.</text>
    <font>
      <font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0" />
    </font>
