    <name>Robot_Footer</name>
    <x>30</x>
    <y>825</y>
    <width>980</width>
    <height>50</height>
    <text>Each jog click requests one bounded move in cm. The IOC and shim enforce motion safety and travel limits. Motor enable and calibration remain commissioning procedures; this screen does not enable motors.</text>
    <font>
